  "description": "<p>When developing against Fedora, fcrepo/rest UI provides a quick way to check if a resource has been created, updated or deleted. Current UI is very limited. For instance, it does not have paging mechanism.</p>\n\n<p>Providing a better fcrepo/rest UI would be helpful for developers, system administrators and repository administrators.</p>\n\n<p>For start the following would be very helpful:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Paging mechanism</li>\n\t<li>Tabular view with additional fields/properties, ability to sort on fields/properties</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> </p>",
